      <activity id="4debebaa-cf9d-5c4a-bfac-3cd726b8bb4c" activityNameId="395fe0dd-8097-5e7d-8731-7162a09d658e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, spiral-seam duct, steel, zinc coated, s= 1.0mm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, spiral-seam duct, steel, zinc coated, s= 1.0mm
Disposal of a spiral-seam duct, made of hot-dip galvanized steel sheet with 275g/m2 zinc coating, sheet thickness 1.0 mm, total weight: 9 kg/m2. Including average material for joining ducts. Suspension band, shock absorbing EPDM rubber, threaded rod, suspension profile for fixation on walls or ceilings.;
UUID: 3325f200-9291-442d-b876-66caf428fb24
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3325f200-9291-442d-b876-66caf428fb24.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
